{"cluster_id": "C-4051", "topic": "vacuous GC verdicts", "target": "operations/monitoring", "member_ids": ["B025-068", "B035-054"], "canonical_claim": "The GC scenario harness once queried the removed `min_ack` column, converted the resulting `UNKNOWN_IDENTIFIER` into an empty list, and thereby made every GC verdict vacuously true until the observation error path was fixed. All scenario GC verdicts became vacuous when `framework/observe.gc_log_rows` queried the removed `min_ack` column, caught `UNKNOWN_IDENTIFIER`, and returned an empty row set; `assert_gc_no_failed` then passed on empty input.", "issue_ids": ["S42"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/worklogs/archive/2026-07-24-unattended-publish-confirm.md#L555-L600", "utils/ca-soak/scenarios/BACKLOG.md#L3068-L3095"]}
